    "body": "Implements ADR-017 (docs/decisions/017-display-none.md).\n\n## Summary\n\nlayout.cpp has a hardcoded is_non_rendered_tag helper that skips 7 tags (head, style, script, title, meta, link, base) during layout. This was a pragmatic shortcut from PR #110. ADR-016 added a Display::None enum value but never wired it in. This issue closes that gap: skip through cascade (display: none in ComputedStyle), delete the hardcoded helper.\n\n## Scope\n\n### Change 1: layout.cpp\n\n- Delete is_non_rendered_tag helper.\n- In layout_element's child iteration (both the block-child path and the inline-run collection path), check display_of(child_style) == Display::None and skip.\n\n### Change 2: ua_stylesheet.cpp\n\nAdd 8 display: none rules:\n  head, style, script, title, meta, link, base, template { display: none }\n\nThe template element is added beyond the current skip list because per HTML5 it does not render (its content lives in a separate document fragment).\n\n### Change 3: tests/test_ua_stylesheet.cpp\n\nRule count 14 -> 15.\n\n### Change 4: tests/test_layout.cpp\n\nExisting tests that rely on the skip list behavior (via head containing title or style) should still pass -- the UA stylesheet produces the same effect.\n\nNew tests:\n- div with display: none produces no LayoutBox, no LayoutText, no LayoutInlineContext\n- head with display: block renders (author override works)\n- div with display: none containing a visible child -> child also skipped\n- template does not render\n\n## Behavior (before / after)\n\nhead + title\n  Before: skipped by helper\n  After: skipped by UA head { display: none }\n\ndiv with display:none\n  Before: rendered (helper does not match div)\n  After: skipped (author CSS honored)\n\nhead with display:block\n  Before: skipped (helper fires first)\n  After: rendered (author override)\n\ndiv with display:none containing p\n  Before: rendered\n  After: both div and child skipped\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] is_non_rendered_tag removed from layout.cpp\n- [ ] Display::None skip in both child paths (block and inline)\n- [ ] 8 UA display:none rules (head, style, script, title, meta, link, base, template)\n- [ ] All existing 213 tests pass\n- [ ] New tests: 4 layout tests, ua_stylesheet count updated\n- [ ] grep -rl \"lexbor/\" src/ returns only src/renderer/html/convert.cpp\n- [ ] CI green\n\n## Refs\n\n- ADR-017: docs/decisions/017-display-none.md\n- ADR-016: docs/decisions/016-inline-formatting.md\n- ADR-011: docs/decisions/011-first-paint.md\n",
